#: kio_floppy.cpp:227
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"Make sure the floppy in drive %2 is a DOS-formatted floppy disk \n"
"and that the permissions of the device file (e.g. /dev/fd0) are set correctly "
"(e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Maak seker die sagteskyf in dryf %1 is 'n Dos geformateerde sagteskyf disket \n"
"en wat die regte van die toestel lêer (e.g. /dev/fd0) word stel korrek (e.g. "
"rwxrwxrwx)."

